---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="Advertise on RigGamer — PC Gaming Audience"
  description="Reach a targeted PC gaming audience on RigGamer. Guides, reviews, and setup content — contact us for advertising."
>
<div class="legal-wrap">
  <div class="legal-inner">

    <div class="legal-hero">
      <div class="legal-kicker">// Media Kit</div>
      <h1>Advertise on RigGamer</h1>
      <p class="legal-meta">Reach PC gamers actively researching their next game</p>
    </div>

    <div class="legal-body">

      <h2>Our Audience</h2>
      <p>RigGamer attracts PC gamers searching for honest reviews, beginner guides, and game comparisons. Our readers are actively evaluating whether to try a game — making them highly receptive to relevant game offers.</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Primary market:</strong> US, UK, Australia, Germany, Canada</li>
        <li><strong>Content focus:</strong> Free-to-play PC games, gacha RPGs, open-world games</li>
        <li><strong>Reader intent:</strong> Research and decision-making — high purchase/play intent</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Advertising Options</h2>
      <table class="legal-table">
        <thead>
          <tr><th>Format</th><th>Placement</th><th>Details</th></tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr><td>Leaderboard Banner</td><td>Top of every page, below nav</td><td>728×90 or 728×146 — GIF / WebP / static</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Sidebar Box</td><td>Article sidebar, sticky on desktop</td><td>300×250 — standard IAB unit</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Mid-Article Banner</td><td>Inside article body, ~50% scroll depth</td><td>728×146 — high visibility</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Sticky Dock</td><td>Bottom of screen after scroll</td><td>728×146 — dismissible, high CTR</td></tr>
          <tr><td>Sponsored Review / Guide</td><td>Full editorial article</td><td>Labelled "sponsored" — CTA integrated</td></tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>

      <h2>Affiliate Program</h2>
      <p>We prefer affiliate (Cost Per Play / Cost Per Install) arrangements over flat-rate display advertising. If you have a game on PC and an active affiliate program, <a href="/contact/">get in touch</a>.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Send your enquiry to <a href="mailto:contact@riggamer.com">contact@riggamer.com</a> with the subject line <strong>Advertising</strong>. Include your game name, platform, and preferred arrangement.</p>

    </div>

    <div class="legal-footer-nav">
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
      <a href="/disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
</Base>

<style>
.legal-wrap { background: var(--bg); padding: 48px 0 80px; }
.legal-inner { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 20px; }
.legal-hero { margin-bottom: 40px; padding-bottom: 28px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-kicker { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: .14em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--volt); margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-hero h1 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); font-weight: 700; color: #fff; margin-bottom: 12px; }
.legal-meta { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 13px; color: var(--t4); }
.legal-body h2 { font-family: var(--fd); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #fff; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .03em; margin: 2em 0 .7em; padding-bottom: 6px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); }
.legal-body p { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin-bottom: 1em; }
.legal-body ul { color: var(--t2); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.75; margin: .5em 0 1em 1.4em; }
.legal-body ul li { margin-bottom: .4em; }
.legal-body a { color: var(--volt); border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(198,255,51,.3); transition: border-color .15s; }
.legal-body a:hover { border-color: var(--volt); }
.legal-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1em 0 1.5em; font-size: 14px; }
.legal-table th { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; color: var(--t4); padding: 8px 12px; text-align: left; border-bottom: 2px solid var(--brd2); }
.legal-table td { padding: 10px 12px; color: var(--t2); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--brd); vertical-align: top; }
.legal-table td:first-child { color: var(--t1); font-weight: 600; white-space: nowrap; }
.legal-footer-nav { display: flex; gap: 20px; margin-top: 48px; padding-top: 24px; border-top: 1px solid var(--brd); flex-wrap: wrap; }
.legal-footer-nav a { font-family: var(--fm); font-size: 12px; color: var(--t3); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: .06em; transition: color .15s; }
.legal-footer-nav a:hover { color: var(--volt); }
</style>
